#: includes/plugin/class-elderward-admin-hardening.php:198
msgid "Hardening tells the web server to refuse requests it should never serve: PHP dropped into uploads, copies of wp-config.php, .git folders, WordPress internals. It does not remove malware, but it stops many attacks from working and keeps a planted web shell from running."
msgstr ""

