msgid "Your web server"
msgstr ""

#: includes/plugin/class-elderward-admin-hardening.php:210
msgid "Apache and LiteSpeed read rules from .htaccess files inside the site's folders, so Elderward can write them for you. Nginx reads its configuration only from the server's own files, which PHP cannot (and should not) change: Elderward gives you a file to add to it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/plugin/class-elderward-admin-hardening.php:211
msgid "Not sure? Most shared hosting runs Apache or LiteSpeed. Your host's documentation or support can tell you."
